WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.125
And some hamachi. Two pieces.


00:03:33.917 --> 00:03:35.833
What is a "holiday roll"?


00:03:38.458 --> 00:03:39.458
Okay.


00:03:40.208 --> 00:03:41.292
Thank you.


00:03:45.417 --> 00:03:47.333
I'm late, I know. Sorry.


00:03:48.417 --> 00:03:50.042
They kept me at work an extra hour.


00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:51.292
Are you okay?


00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:52.375
Okay.


00:03:52.958 --> 00:03:54.000
What's that?


00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:55.542
I fell off my bike.


00:03:56.125 --> 00:03:57.542
- That thing?
- Yeah.


00:03:58.542 --> 00:03:59.917
Looks like you never rode it.


00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:01.125
And you see why?


00:04:03.333 --> 00:04:06.542
You've carefully avoided saying what this job is.


00:04:07.833 --> 00:04:09.583
I told you, it's entry level.


00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:12.708
But there's a fast track to promotion.


00:04:12.875 --> 00:04:13.833
Kind of manager.


00:04:14.042 --> 00:04:15.500
Kind of McDonald's?


00:04:16.167 --> 00:04:16.833
Yeah.


00:04:18.125 --> 00:04:20.625
I brought you a present.


00:04:21.917 --> 00:04:23.250
It's from Josie, really.


00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:25.375
It was her idea.


00:04:26.917 --> 00:04:28.250
You look very handsome.


00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:33.292
We'll go back and take another photo after the birth.


00:04:33.583 --> 00:04:35.042
Like a before and after.


00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.667
Josie's full of ideas for decorating.


00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.958
She never had her own place till now.


00:04:41.708 --> 00:04:43.917
How much do you need for the apartment?


00:04:46.583 --> 00:04:47.333
I didn't ask for money.


00:04:47.417 --> 00:04:49.417
No, it was me, hearing voices.


00:04:49.875 --> 00:04:53.083
I planned to ask you to provide collateral, not money.


00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.917
And Josie's boyfriends?


00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:59.750
Any of them moving in, too?


00:04:59.833 --> 00:05:01.375
No, why...


00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:04.167
Shit! It was just cleaned.


00:05:10.167 --> 00:05:12.083
That girl is clearly dysfunctional.


00:05:12.208 --> 00:05:13.667
You know nothing about her.


00:05:14.875 --> 00:05:18.125
Except she was raised in a commune by unwashed idiots.


00:05:18.208 --> 00:05:19.500
An arts collective.


00:05:19.667 --> 00:05:22.083
Why you? What's she after?


00:05:22.167 --> 00:05:24.708
What could she be after? I have no money.


00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:26.708
I have.


00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:28.375
What's with you today?


00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:39.625
I'll give you 3 months' rent.
But I look at the place first.


00:05:39.833 --> 00:05:41.625
I didn't want to pressure you.


00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:43.958
You won. Quit while you're ahead.


00:05:54.417 --> 00:05:56.042
- Bye.
- Bye.


00:06:58.583 --> 00:07:01.292
Change all the locks, upstairs and down.


00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:02.875
Okay.


00:07:03.542 --> 00:07:05.625
I left the key in the mailbox.


00:07:05.708 --> 00:07:07.375
Thanks a lot.


00:07:07.625 --> 00:07:09.542
You've seen Vincent's apartment?


00:07:09.625 --> 00:07:12.375
6 months ago, he was dealing weed
and getting into fights.


00:07:12.458 --> 00:07:13.875
You see him as a family man?


00:07:14.083 --> 00:07:16.667
That bitch Josie is a real menace.


00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:19.500
He just doesn't see it.


00:07:51.292 --> 00:07:52.750
Kwan, we agreed


00:07:52.833 --> 00:07:55.458
the orgasmic convulsions are way too timid.


00:07:55.625 --> 00:07:57.333
As if they're scared of sex.


00:07:57.417 --> 00:07:59.000
I upped it 5 times.


00:07:59.083 --> 00:08:00.667
You can't tell. Push it.


00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.542
Can we discuss the real issues?


00:08:03.958 --> 00:08:06.458
We get one shot at Activision,


00:08:06.667 --> 00:08:08.583
but our controller is so crappy


00:08:08.667 --> 00:08:11.542
the demo is almost unplayable.


00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:16.792
What's the point coming up with
hyper realistic environments for Stix


00:08:16.875 --> 00:08:19.667
if the player throws the controller
through the screen!


00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:23.125
Kurt, you're off track,
focusing on known glitches.


00:08:23.208 --> 00:08:23.875
No.


00:08:24.958 --> 00:08:26.583
The real problem is right there.


00:08:28.167 --> 00:08:32.458
The real problem is, your background
in publishing and literature


00:08:32.542 --> 00:08:36.667
is completely inappropriate for
evaluating playability.


00:08:41.083 --> 00:08:46.042
Okay, maybe Anna and I should've
founded a different sort of company.


00:08:46.292 --> 00:08:48.833
Maybe Kronos was only a hit


00:08:48.917 --> 00:08:50.958
thanks to your genius ideas.


00:08:51.333 --> 00:08:54.917
Maybe we're just two bitches who got lucky.


00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.083
But the fact is,


00:08:56.167 --> 00:08:58.708
the boss here is me.


00:08:59.542 --> 00:09:01.333
And we're 6 months behind.


00:09:07.083 --> 00:09:09.333
Our goal is simple, as you all know.


00:09:09.417 --> 00:09:11.000
When the player guts an orc,


00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:13.583
he needs to feel the blood on his hands.


00:09:13.875 --> 00:09:15.375
Thick, warm blood.


00:09:15.583 --> 00:09:16.875
If at all possible.


00:09:16.958 --> 00:09:18.167
Let's go.


00:09:19.167 --> 00:09:20.458
I love you.


00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:28.542
Does Kurt hate me or is it just me?


00:09:28.667 --> 00:09:30.625
No, he hates you.


00:09:31.083 --> 00:09:33.042
They all hate you, except Kevin.


00:09:33.125 --> 00:09:36.125
He really loves you. even if he tries to laugh it off.


00:09:38.375 --> 00:09:40.167
And you knew it, right?


00:09:49.792 --> 00:09:50.917
Press here.


00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:53.083
She knows I want a full STD panel?


00:09:53.167 --> 00:09:54.333
Yes, of course.


00:09:54.542 --> 00:09:57.667
If you're worried about a recent exposure,


00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.375
I can prescribe a PEP.


00:09:59.833 --> 00:10:02.708
No, I looked online. Too many side effects.


00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.375
I can't miss any work.


00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.167
I guess we roll the dice.


00:10:30.875 --> 00:10:31.667
Hello?


00:10:32.125 --> 00:10:34.083
My evening just cleared up.


00:10:35.292 --> 00:10:37.292
- I can't.
- Make an effort.


00:10:37.375 --> 00:10:39.750
I can't. I have...


00:10:40.958 --> 00:10:43.583
I have my period. I'm not well.


00:10:44.125 --> 00:10:45.875
I'll wear a condom.


00:10:47.042 --> 00:10:48.750
I appreciate your sense of sacrifice.


00:10:48.833 --> 00:10:51.042
A little blood doesn't turn me off.


00:10:51.167 --> 00:10:52.333
No, I can't.


00:10:52.625 --> 00:10:53.583
See you.


00:11:00.958 --> 00:11:04.042
Scum!


00:11:38.333 --> 00:11:39.708
You and your father.


00:11:39.917 --> 00:11:41.375
I love everything you do to me.


00:11:41.875 --> 00:11:44.833
Let's do it again.


00:11:48.833 --> 00:11:50.458
Next time, ring the bell.


00:11:50.833 --> 00:11:54.250
If you want to avoid being treated to upsetting sights,


00:11:54.333 --> 00:11:57.542
Then you won't be treated to gruesome sights.


00:11:57.833 --> 00:11:59.750
I'd better put some pants on.


00:12:02.167 --> 00:12:03.625
How much do you pay them?


00:12:03.833 --> 00:12:06.125
-It's pitiful! -Save your pity.


00:12:06.208 --> 00:12:07.625
I'm not ashamed.


00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.750
It's my life. My sex life.


00:12:09.833 --> 00:12:11.375
You're a little bitch, Michèle.


00:12:11.458 --> 00:12:14.167
I'm just saying, with your finances. be careful.


00:12:14.292 --> 00:12:15.958
Did you eat? I made spaghetti.


00:12:16.042 --> 00:12:17.417
I'll take a coffee.


00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.583
- Not taking your coat off?
- I'm cold.


00:12:22.917 --> 00:12:24.667
You had more work done?


00:12:24.875 --> 00:12:26.458
Will you stop going on about that?


00:12:27.833 --> 00:12:29.292
I'm sorry.


00:12:29.375 --> 00:12:31.458
Just a little Botox.


00:12:31.708 --> 00:12:33.083
It's your business.


00:12:36.708 --> 00:12:37.292
Very good.


00:12:37.375 --> 00:12:38.667
You seem surprised.


00:12:38.833 --> 00:12:40.167
Better like this?


00:12:40.958 --> 00:12:43.500
Michèle, some other time, I have to take off.


00:12:43.708 --> 00:12:45.083
No. not yet.


00:12:50.792 --> 00:12:53.000
My mother told you she's HIV-positive?


00:12:53.167 --> 00:12:55.583
I warned Ralf you'd try that one.


00:12:55.875 --> 00:12:57.375
Nice meeting you.


00:13:02.667 --> 00:13:04.833
One question. Think before you answer.


00:13:05.083 --> 00:13:07.292
What would you say if I remarried?


00:13:07.375 --> 00:13:09.000
It's simple, I'd kill you.


00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:10.542
No need to think.


00:13:10.833 --> 00:13:13.875
You always wanted a sanitized version of life.


00:13:13.958 --> 00:13:15.542
You asked, I answered.


00:13:15.833 --> 00:13:16.917
I'd kill you.


00:13:17.333 --> 00:13:19.958
You're so selfish, it's frightening.


00:13:20.458 --> 00:13:21.458
I know.


00:13:24.417 --> 00:13:26.250
By the way, here's your check.


00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.625
You never give anything truly of yourself.


00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:35.000
- Your father, it's such an ordeal?
- Don't.


00:13:35.083 --> 00:13:37.125
- He's old.
- Still breathing.


00:13:37.208 --> 00:13:38.708
Some bonds never break.


00:13:38.792 --> 00:13:40.958
I walk in and it's one horror after another.


00:13:41.042 --> 00:13:42.667
He has a parole hearing.


00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:45.000
That's enough. Okay?


00:13:49.125 --> 00:13:51.417
Your stud forgot his hernia belt.


00:13:58.667 --> 00:14:00.792
- You need a hand?
- No, I've got it.


00:14:03.167 --> 00:14:04.583
Is it big enough?


00:14:05.125 --> 00:14:07.667
Any taller and the star will scrape the ceiling.


00:14:10.917 --> 00:14:11.917
Michèle!


00:14:12.625 --> 00:14:13.292
Evening.


00:14:13.375 --> 00:14:15.917
I'm so glad I caught you. Here...


00:14:16.292 --> 00:14:17.792
I'm handing these out.


00:14:17.917 --> 00:14:20.792
It's about the Board's trash separation policy.


00:14:20.875 --> 00:14:21.708
Thank you.


00:14:21.792 --> 00:14:24.750
The fines for non-compliance are exorbitant.


00:14:24.833 --> 00:14:27.042
We're meeting Wednesday to oppose it.


00:14:27.125 --> 00:14:29.208
You're on the Board, aren't you?


00:14:29.292 --> 00:14:31.500
- Yes.
- I've tried to point out


00:14:31.667 --> 00:14:33.667
that minor conflict of interest.


00:14:34.292 --> 00:14:36.000
It's an interesting position.


00:14:36.167 --> 00:14:37.958
Yes, that's right. Exactly.


00:14:38.625 --> 00:14:40.250
I hope you can make it.


00:14:40.375 --> 00:14:41.458
Perhaps.


00:14:41.625 --> 00:14:42.917
-Goodnight. -Goodnight.


00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.583
I'll just deliver these.


00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.833
Be right back!


00:15:04.167 --> 00:15:05.458
- Good evening.
- Good evening.


00:15:05.792 --> 00:15:09.125
Last one. Your new keys are on the table.


00:15:09.292 --> 00:15:10.375
Thank you.


00:15:11.833 --> 00:15:14.292
Did you notice the back door jams?


00:15:15.375 --> 00:15:17.833
I only do locks.


00:15:18.708 --> 00:15:20.833
How come?


00:15:20.917 --> 00:15:21.875
Okay.


00:15:50.333 --> 00:15:51.750
How'd you get out there?


00:15:54.458 --> 00:15:55.583
Come on in.


00:16:51.875 --> 00:16:55.292
You didn't have to claw his eyes out but scratch him at least.


00:16:55.458 --> 00:16:57.208
I'm just saying.


00:17:14.325 --> 00:17:16.325
I found you very narrow, for a woman of your age


00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:25.450
That one's 25.


00:17:29.992 --> 00:17:31.617
That's the Safety Angel.


00:17:31.783 --> 00:17:33.658
- The most powerful?
- Serious stuff.


00:17:33.825 --> 00:17:36.450
0.2 oz of pepper spray at 110 mph.


00:17:36.617 --> 00:17:38.408
Gives you quite an advantage.


00:17:39.033 --> 00:17:40.033
I'll take it.


00:17:50.325 --> 00:17:51.617
And this.


00:18:31.408 --> 00:18:32.450
Hey, you!


00:18:34.033 --> 00:18:35.867
You told Vincent you'd pay his rent?


00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:38.200
No, I said I'd help out for a while.


00:18:38.367 --> 00:18:40.408
Mr. Casamayou, your table's ready.


00:18:41.075 --> 00:18:44.367
Don't expect me to pitch in. I'm stone broke.


00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.075
I'm the one who made the promise.


00:18:46.492 --> 00:18:47.825
Why?


00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.367
Struggling to get by builds character.


00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:51.992
Trouble is, he's dating a psycho.


00:18:52.075 --> 00:18:53.492
Thank you very much.


00:18:53.783 --> 00:18:56.825
The wacko won't tolerate struggling.


00:18:56.908 --> 00:18:58.283
Psycho's the word.


00:18:58.367 --> 00:19:01.033
Often though, that kind of girl's good in bed.


00:19:01.367 --> 00:19:03.408
What does that even mean, "good in bed"?


00:19:04.367 --> 00:19:06.783
- I never knew.
- You read my proposal?


00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:14.075
Richard, would you say I'm tight for a woman my age?


00:19:15.492 --> 00:19:16.617
Hi there!


00:19:17.242 --> 00:19:19.825
- Hi.
- Thanks.


00:19:20.033 --> 00:19:21.408
What's up, loser?


00:19:21.492 --> 00:19:22.658
How are you, pumpkin?


00:19:22.742 --> 00:19:26.742
Just in time to hear Michèle avoid giving her thoughts on my game idea.


00:19:26.825 --> 00:19:28.242
No! It was very interesting.


00:19:28.325 --> 00:19:29.825
You bet it's interesting.


00:19:29.908 --> 00:19:31.742
Tell all.


00:19:32.242 --> 00:19:33.617
- Bubbly, 4 glasses.
- No. a bottle!


00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:37.367
It's set in a time when dogs have been wiped out by a virus.


00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:40.325
So people have robotic canines as pets.


00:19:40.492 --> 00:19:42.867
The player's the Spartacus of the robot-dog world.


00:19:44.242 --> 00:19:45.158
Original.


00:19:50.033 --> 00:19:51.242
Interesting.


00:19:51.908 --> 00:19:53.575
I have something to tell you all.


00:19:57.033 --> 00:20:01.533
I was looking for a way of simply and naturally


00:20:01.617 --> 00:20:04.117
tossing this out. but I can't find one.


00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:06.617
So...


00:20:07.533 --> 00:20:09.492
Here goes. I was assaulted...


00:20:09.658 --> 00:20:11.033
...at home.


00:20:13.033 --> 00:20:14.742
I guess I was raped.


00:20:17.075 --> 00:20:18.033
Raped?


00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:21.158
- Oh, my god.
- For real?


00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.200
When?


00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.825
Thursday, at 3pm.


00:20:26.283 --> 00:20:27.367
And you never said?


00:20:27.908 --> 00:20:30.950
I don't know what to say. What can I say?


00:20:31.242 --> 00:20:32.783
Oh, my god!


00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:36.408
- I feel stupid for bringing it up.
- Are you insane?


00:20:37.325 --> 00:20:39.200
A Piper-Heidsieck.


00:20:39.742 --> 00:20:40.575
Very good.


00:20:42.075 --> 00:20:44.325
Wait a few minutes before popping it.


00:20:47.658 --> 00:20:49.200
Are you alright?


00:20:49.742 --> 00:20:51.075
You have to see a doctor.


00:20:51.325 --> 00:20:52.492
Done that.


00:20:52.617 --> 00:20:54.367
What did the cops say?


00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:57.908
You didn't report it?


00:20:58.617 --> 00:21:01.242
Michèle, you have to report it immediately.


00:21:01.325 --> 00:21:02.242
What for?


00:21:02.617 --> 00:21:03.783
What for!


00:21:03.992 --> 00:21:06.533
It's over. It doesn't need talking about anymore.


00:21:07.117 --> 00:21:08.658
It's not worth a debate.


00:21:13.325 --> 00:21:14.908
How about we order?


00:21:17.825 --> 00:21:19.117
You avoid the police because...


00:21:19.158 --> 00:21:21.450
Of course I avoid the police "because!"


00:21:21.533 --> 00:21:24.117
I won't deal with the police ever again.


00:21:24.408 --> 00:21:26.450
- See you!
- See you!


00:21:26.825 --> 00:21:29.950
- I'll get you a gun.
- A gun! You're out of your mind.


00:21:30.283 --> 00:21:31.742
Richard. I should tell you...


00:21:31.908 --> 00:21:35.033
Your proposal, our investors aren't interested.


00:21:35.117 --> 00:21:36.658
I don't want to discuss it now.


00:21:37.117 --> 00:21:39.033
But I'd like your opinion on it.


00:21:39.117 --> 00:21:42.075
It's got nothing to do with the quality of your work.


00:21:42.325 --> 00:21:46.450
It's a business that's tied into a particular demographic.


00:21:46.533 --> 00:21:48.825
A demographic oblivious to quality?


00:21:48.908 --> 00:21:50.200
Exactly.


00:21:50.283 --> 00:21:51.908
Come on, I can take it!


00:21:51.992 --> 00:21:53.867
Be honest. What did you think of it?


00:21:54.033 --> 00:21:57.325
Richard, go back to your novel. You're a writer.


00:21:57.450 --> 00:21:59.158
Sure. A penniless writer.


00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:03.200
Somebody trashed your fender.


00:22:05.408 --> 00:22:06.367
Somebody?


00:22:08.825 --> 00:22:10.117
See you.


00:22:21.908 --> 00:22:23.075
Shit!


00:22:27.075 --> 00:22:28.325
Here you go.


00:22:33.367 --> 00:22:35.200
I'll be right there, I...


00:22:35.367 --> 00:22:37.450
I'll just grab my jacket.


00:22:41.617 --> 00:22:43.242
You got my sundae?


00:22:45.575 --> 00:22:47.283
Thanks. See you tomorrow.


00:22:58.617 --> 00:22:59.700
Here, for you.


00:22:59.783 --> 00:23:01.783
- For me?
- Yes, made it myself.


00:23:01.867 --> 00:23:03.617
That's so sweet.


00:23:12.575 --> 00:23:14.658
- Delicious.
- Not bad, right?


00:23:18.158 --> 00:23:19.700
Mrs. Leblanc? Hello.


00:23:19.783 --> 00:23:20.242
Hello


00:23:20.325 --> 00:23:22.492
I'm Philippe, from the agency.


00:23:22.575 --> 00:23:24.867
Vincent, good timing, I need you here.


00:23:24.950 --> 00:23:26.283
Hey, Michèle.


00:23:26.325 --> 00:23:28.575
-What can I do? -Stand against the wall.


00:23:28.658 --> 00:23:30.200
- Yeah?
- Yeah.


00:23:30.867 --> 00:23:32.075
With your arms...


00:23:32.242 --> 00:23:36.325
The bookcase is 5 feet wide. I want to visualize it.


00:23:36.492 --> 00:23:37.867
Like this, okay?


00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:38.950
Vincent...


00:23:38.992 --> 00:23:42.450
Don't act the bookcase. Be the bookcase.


00:23:44.658 --> 00:23:45.908
Okay, hold this.


00:23:46.867 --> 00:23:49.408
Vincent is quite the actor.


00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:51.367
Are you hurt?


00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:52.867
- No.
- No, it's fine.


00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:56.367
Age 12, he was young Achilles in Kronos.


00:23:56.533 --> 00:23:58.242
A video game I produced.


00:23:58.325 --> 00:23:59.617
Yeah?


00:24:00.158 --> 00:24:02.325
I bet you were the cutest knight in armor.


00:24:02.408 --> 00:24:03.950
Not too shabby.


00:24:13.408 --> 00:24:14.992
Nice, huh?


00:24:15.367 --> 00:24:17.450
A little too nice, don't you think?


00:24:17.533 --> 00:24:20.492
There's room for a 50-inch here.


00:24:20.575 --> 00:24:21.908
Did you ask her?


00:24:23.242 --> 00:24:25.367
You mentioned a microwave,


00:24:25.450 --> 00:24:29.450
but we thought a TV makes a better housewarming present.


00:24:29.742 --> 00:24:32.367
Don't you need an oven more than a TV?


00:24:32.450 --> 00:24:35.408
We don't need one. The kitchen comes fully equipped.


00:24:36.283 --> 00:24:38.408
Is this the apartment you told me about?


00:24:38.492 --> 00:24:41.158
No, it's a 2-bedroom here.


00:24:41.283 --> 00:24:43.533
$250 a month more.


00:24:43.783 --> 00:24:47.075
The other one was a dump. Nowhere to put a crib.


00:24:47.158 --> 00:24:48.450
Totally insane.


00:24:48.658 --> 00:24:51.117
Dump, I don't think so.


00:24:51.825 --> 00:24:54.158
Basic, maybe.


00:24:54.700 --> 00:24:55.825
Dump, definitely not.


00:24:57.867 --> 00:24:59.450
Basic, sure.


00:25:02.408 --> 00:25:05.325
You realize having a child is all about suffering?


00:25:05.658 --> 00:25:07.950
Vincent's birth was sheer hell.


00:25:08.075 --> 00:25:09.367
Torture.


00:25:09.783 --> 00:25:10.950
Three hours of agony.


00:25:10.992 --> 00:25:12.992
If you don't want to help us, don't.


00:25:13.575 --> 00:25:14.450
Nobody's forcing you.


00:25:14.533 --> 00:25:16.617
How'll you get by if I don't?


00:25:18.117 --> 00:25:19.450
That's our problem.


00:25:19.700 --> 00:25:22.450
You can't talk to me like that and take my money.


00:25:22.533 --> 00:25:24.742
I don't give a shit about your money.


00:25:24.908 --> 00:25:26.325
I never asked for it.


00:25:28.242 --> 00:25:31.158
You just stand there, saying nothing, as usual!


00:25:31.450 --> 00:25:35.242
It's bullshit! When are you going to get off your ass?


00:25:39.867 --> 00:25:41.242
Butt out, you!


00:25:41.325 --> 00:25:43.658
You realize that this is impossible?


00:25:43.742 --> 00:25:45.158
-What? -She's a lunatic.


00:25:45.242 --> 00:25:47.450
She's not. she's my girlfriend.


00:25:48.033 --> 00:25:49.950
You refuse to see I've changed.


00:25:51.992 --> 00:25:53.950
What do you feel now?


00:25:54.033 --> 00:25:55.700
Fear or anger?


00:25:55.783 --> 00:25:57.200
Anger.


00:25:57.908 --> 00:26:00.700
You've missed your wife. Anna's in Angoulême today.


00:26:04.117 --> 00:26:05.783
And you knew it.


00:26:18.575 --> 00:26:21.242
You know I went through a traumatic
experience...


00:26:21.617 --> 00:26:22.742
Recently.


00:26:23.950 --> 00:26:27.325
You gave the impression of soldiering on like nothing happened.


00:26:29.117 --> 00:26:31.200
If I seem insensitive, I'm sorry.


00:26:31.283 --> 00:26:32.867
That's just me, right?


00:26:34.117 --> 00:26:35.825
I see you're staying in character.


00:26:36.158 --> 00:26:39.742
A big part of my character


00:26:50.992 --> 00:26:54.367
is being unpredictable.


00:26:58.117 --> 00:26:59.158
Hold on.


00:28:54.033 --> 00:28:57.158
Say, have you experienced any incidents recently?


00:28:57.242 --> 00:28:57.992
Incidents?


00:28:58.075 --> 00:28:59.700
You know what I mean.


00:28:59.783 --> 00:29:03.158
A man threw pizza at me from his car. He missed.


00:29:03.325 --> 00:29:06.450
People were staring at me at the market.


00:29:06.658 --> 00:29:08.200
But I always feel that.


00:29:08.783 --> 00:29:10.992
I wonder if it isn't starting again.


00:29:11.450 --> 00:29:12.908
A new cycle.


00:29:13.075 --> 00:29:14.450
You don't know?


00:29:14.867 --> 00:29:18.658
The Accused Will Rise about your father aired again last Saturday.


00:29:18.742 --> 00:29:21.450
- Refreshes people's memories.
- I'd no idea.


00:29:21.908 --> 00:29:22.992
And you?


00:29:23.450 --> 00:29:25.325
Anything happened?


00:29:25.408 --> 00:29:26.908
No, nothing special.


00:29:28.867 --> 00:29:30.742
It's because of his parole hearing.


00:29:30.950 --> 00:29:32.450
A media feeding frenzy.


00:29:32.700 --> 00:29:34.492
He's up before the judge next week.


00:29:35.117 --> 00:29:36.283
You don't miss a beat.


00:29:36.367 --> 00:29:38.325
Two coffees, please.


00:29:38.700 --> 00:29:39.908
Come with me.


00:29:39.992 --> 00:29:42.950
They'll never let him out. Thank god!


00:29:43.492 --> 00:29:45.658
The parole hearing is a charade.


00:29:45.742 --> 00:29:47.408
Like you telling me to come,


00:29:47.492 --> 00:29:49.825
when you know I'd rather gouge my eyes out.


00:29:49.908 --> 00:29:51.658
How long will you hang on to hatred?


00:29:51.742 --> 00:29:55.075
I'll never see him again, in this world or any other.


00:29:55.158 --> 00:29:56.908
- Anyway, there is no other.
- Your coffee.


00:29:56.992 --> 00:29:58.908
- There isn't much time left.
- Thanks.


00:29:58.992 --> 00:30:00.117
He's ill.


00:30:01.283 --> 00:30:02.533
Look...


00:30:03.742 --> 00:30:05.367
Look, just for one moment.


00:30:07.158 --> 00:30:09.242
You're afraid to look at your own father?


00:30:17.533 --> 00:30:19.075
Put it away now.


00:30:20.658 --> 00:30:22.075
You're not like the mob.


00:30:22.408 --> 00:30:24.492
People who only know the monster.


00:30:24.950 --> 00:30:27.450
You know the man. He's just a man.


00:30:27.533 --> 00:30:29.450
Who happens to be a monster.


00:30:29.533 --> 00:30:31.492
You see a contradiction there?


00:30:33.158 --> 00:30:35.283
Drink up. I'm done here.


00:30:36.325 --> 00:30:37.783
Be careful, won't you?


00:30:38.117 --> 00:30:40.783
Some people won't just toss crap


00:30:40.867 --> 00:30:42.283
from their cars.


00:31:47.742 --> 00:31:49.075
Marty!


00:31:53.325 --> 00:31:54.742
Give me that bird.


00:31:55.450 --> 00:31:56.783
Marty!


00:31:58.242 --> 00:32:00.658
We don't treat wild birds. It's a sparrow?


00:32:01.200 --> 00:32:02.158
Yes.


00:32:03.075 --> 00:32:05.992
I wouldn't even know how to intubate your sparrow.


00:32:06.075 --> 00:32:07.658
If it is a sparrow.


00:32:09.908 --> 00:32:11.492
Thanks very much.


00:32:11.742 --> 00:32:12.617
Goodbye.


00:32:12.700 --> 00:32:14.158
You're welcome. Goodbye.


00:32:30.700 --> 00:32:32.533
...victims of all ages.


00:32:33.117 --> 00:32:37.075
Seen today, this quiet street in the suburbs of Nantes


00:32:37.242 --> 00:32:40.783
bears no trace of the atrocities that took place here


00:32:40.867 --> 00:32:42.283
39 years ago.


00:32:42.992 --> 00:32:44.867
Few of today's inhabitants


00:32:44.950 --> 00:32:46.492
know the name, Georges Leblanc.


00:32:47.033 --> 00:32:48.533
Or if they do,


00:32:49.117 --> 00:32:51.908
it's a name associated with a horror story


00:32:51.992 --> 00:32:53.742
that they can hardly remember.


00:32:54.200 --> 00:32:56.908
An urban folktale from another time.


00:32:57.283 --> 00:32:59.617
And yet, in 1976,


00:32:59.700 --> 00:33:02.825
the eyes of France were trained on this street.


00:33:03.492 --> 00:33:05.283
A nation held its breath.


00:33:05.408 --> 00:33:06.908
In shock.


00:33:07.492 --> 00:33:08.908
Time has dulled the terror


00:33:08.992 --> 00:33:11.075
of that distant day in May.


00:33:11.492 --> 00:33:14.450
But for some the horror will never fade away.


00:33:14.992 --> 00:33:17.117
Nor will the unanswered questions.


00:33:17.867 --> 00:33:20.200
What drove Georges Leblanc,


00:33:20.325 --> 00:33:21.783
a practising Catholic,


00:33:21.867 --> 00:33:23.617
loving husband and father,


00:33:23.700 --> 00:33:26.783
to commit such monstrous and senseless acts?


00:33:27.575 --> 00:33:31.950
And what role exactly was played by his daughter, Michèle?


00:33:32.492 --> 00:33:34.783
A ten-year-old child at the time.


00:33:38.575 --> 00:33:41.242
After years of trials and psychiatric evaluations,


00:33:41.283 --> 00:33:44.325
over 30 years after Georges Leblanc's incarceration,


00:33:44.367 --> 00:33:46.283
sentenced to life,


00:33:46.450 --> 00:33:49.325
the questions remain,


00:33:49.575 --> 00:33:50.992
as banal yet chilling as ever.


00:33:51.617 --> 00:33:52.700
First and foremost...


00:33:53.033 --> 00:33:54.075
Why?


00:33:54.158 --> 00:33:55.658
Murderer!


00:34:11.783 --> 00:34:13.450
I hope that's recyclable.


00:34:14.158 --> 00:34:15.617
It's a dead bird.


00:35:46.658 --> 00:35:47.908
Richard!


00:35:52.742 --> 00:35:54.200
What were you thinking?


00:35:54.408 --> 00:35:56.117
I was worried about you.


00:35:56.200 --> 00:35:57.325
Jesus!


00:35:57.575 --> 00:35:59.325
Don't rub your eyes.


00:36:03.075 --> 00:36:05.200
You say you were raped and didn't report it,


00:36:05.283 --> 00:36:06.658
obviously I'm going to...


00:36:07.117 --> 00:36:09.908
Holy shit, you really did a number on me!


00:36:09.992 --> 00:36:11.575
I'm sorry.


00:36:12.325 --> 00:36:14.533
That helps? You know what you're doing?


00:36:14.617 --> 00:36:16.742
It's on the pepper spray label.


00:36:16.908 --> 00:36:18.200
Could be, I'll go blind.


00:36:18.283 --> 00:36:20.075
Of course, you won't go blind!


00:36:21.033 --> 00:36:22.242
There we go.


00:36:24.450 --> 00:36:26.575
- Glass of wine?
- Yes, please.


00:36:27.908 --> 00:36:30.492
I didn't recognize the car. Whose is it?


00:36:30.658 --> 00:36:31.950
A friend's.


00:36:32.367 --> 00:36:33.492
A girl friend's?


00:36:34.617 --> 00:36:36.742
- Her name's Hélène.
- Hélène.


00:36:39.242 --> 00:36:41.492
I borrowed hers. Mine's in the shop.


00:36:41.658 --> 00:36:43.408
Somebody smashed the bumper.


00:36:44.742 --> 00:36:46.075
It was barely visible.


00:36:50.992 --> 00:36:52.617
She's a friend, Michèle.


00:36:52.700 --> 00:36:54.408
Why am I even justifying this?


00:36:54.492 --> 00:36:56.117
You have nothing to justify.


00:36:57.742 --> 00:36:59.992
- She's a student?
- Grad student.


00:37:00.533 --> 00:37:01.950
Surprise me.


00:37:02.117 --> 00:37:05.617
She's not my student. She organizes a De Beauvoir seminar.


00:37:05.700 --> 00:37:07.158
She invited me to speak.


00:37:07.367 --> 00:37:08.575
And she's read your book.


00:37:08.658 --> 00:37:09.742
She's read it.


00:37:09.825 --> 00:37:12.200
And told me how deeply it touched her,


00:37:12.283 --> 00:37:14.158
I melted inside.


00:37:14.242 --> 00:37:16.742
That's all. You can imagine the rest.


00:37:16.825 --> 00:37:18.950
I can imagine just fine, actually.


00:37:19.658 --> 00:37:21.367
Your jealousy is insane.


00:37:21.450 --> 00:37:23.408
No, I'm just concerned.


00:37:25.367 --> 00:37:28.492
I'm concerned because this is what I feared.


00:37:29.450 --> 00:37:31.700
The bimbos with big tits never worried me,


00:37:31.783 --> 00:37:35.492
but a woman who's read:
"The Second Sex" will chew you up...


00:37:36.158 --> 00:37:37.367
And spit you out.


00:37:37.533 --> 00:37:39.825
The real danger, Michèle, is you.


00:37:43.992 --> 00:37:45.867
Did you know about her?


00:37:45.950 --> 00:37:47.575
Yeah, I met her once.


00:37:47.658 --> 00:37:49.158
When was that?


00:37:49.242 --> 00:37:52.658
Last week. We all had dinner at Dad's.


00:37:53.408 --> 00:37:54.825
Why didn't you mention it?


00:37:54.908 --> 00:37:56.200
I dunno...


00:37:56.283 --> 00:37:57.742
Josie, put that down. I'll do it.


00:37:57.950 --> 00:37:59.325
When?


00:37:59.450 --> 00:38:01.825
Can I have some focus here, please?


00:38:01.992 --> 00:38:02.742
What?


00:38:03.325 --> 00:38:04.617
What's Hélène like?


00:38:04.742 --> 00:38:08.367
She's cool. A yoga teacher.
Bikram yoga, I think.


00:38:08.450 --> 00:38:09.867
Move your feet, will you?


00:38:10.283 --> 00:38:11.117
Where?


00:38:11.200 --> 00:38:13.825
- Why?
- I told Eric he could have it.


00:38:13.867 --> 00:38:15.533
Eric? Who's this Eric?


00:38:15.617 --> 00:38:16.867
Marais Yoga Center.


00:38:16.950 --> 00:38:19.617
-Can't it wait? -Move your feet!


00:38:21.700 --> 00:38:23.700
How about you help me unpack?


00:38:23.783 --> 00:38:25.158
I'll be right there.


00:38:25.242 --> 00:38:27.283
The fight'll be over in 10 minutes.


00:38:27.367 --> 00:38:29.200
And soccer next up.


00:38:35.275 --> 00:38:37.233
Josie! Where are you going?


00:38:38.400 --> 00:38:40.317
Vincent, I'll call you back.


00:38:40.400 --> 00:38:41.733
Yeah. bye.


00:38:51.275 --> 00:38:52.400
Seen it?


00:38:52.817 --> 00:38:54.692
It was sent to the whole office?


00:38:54.775 --> 00:38:55.858
Take a look.


00:39:09.983 --> 00:39:12.025
This isn't the first thing he's sent me.


00:39:12.692 --> 00:39:14.358
First thing who's sent you?


00:39:16.608 --> 00:39:18.150
The guy who attacked you?


00:39:18.233 --> 00:39:19.608
Of course.


00:39:19.817 --> 00:39:22.483
You think that's possible? Your attacker?


00:39:22.858 --> 00:39:25.900
I mean, the email seems to come from here.


00:39:25.983 --> 00:39:27.233
Looks like it.


00:39:27.733 --> 00:39:29.025
Call the police now.


00:39:29.108 --> 00:39:31.817
The police, never again. It's pointless.


00:39:31.900 --> 00:39:34.108
This is different. You're the victim.


00:39:34.192 --> 00:39:36.067
I was the victim then!


00:39:37.025 --> 00:39:38.108
Sorry, I...


00:39:38.150 --> 00:39:39.900
I don't want the police involved.


00:39:39.983 --> 00:39:42.525
I won't let this cretin stir up all that shit.


00:39:42.692 --> 00:39:46.567
I fought too hard to rebuild my life, so police, journalists...


00:39:47.192 --> 00:39:48.483
No way.


00:39:48.983 --> 00:39:49.942
God help us.


00:39:50.067 --> 00:39:51.525
There's a nutjob out there.


00:39:51.608 --> 00:39:54.192
Nutjobs, I can handle. My specialty.


00:39:55.317 --> 00:39:57.025
When our server was hacked in June,


00:40:01.108 --> 00:40:04.775
somebody ripped the Cthulhu template off our mainframe.


00:40:05.233 --> 00:40:07.358
Images like these have floated around since then.


00:40:08.608 --> 00:40:10.150
My secret admirer...


00:40:10.233 --> 00:40:12.233
Must be highly tech savvy.


00:40:13.400 --> 00:40:16.358
- A former employee maybe?
- Yeah.


00:40:21.233 --> 00:40:23.483
Last question. You think she's pretty?


00:40:25.942 --> 00:40:27.858
Bend forward, from low in your back.


00:40:27.942 --> 00:40:30.858
Stretch your spine all the way to the floor.


00:40:31.525 --> 00:40:32.650
Deep breath.


00:40:32.733 --> 00:40:36.358
Push the floor with your left hand until seated again.


00:40:36.442 --> 00:40:37.900
Thank you all very much.


00:40:37.983 --> 00:40:40.650
Have a good day. Excellent work.


00:40:42.567 --> 00:40:43.525
Namaste.


00:40:45.067 --> 00:40:45.983
Hélène?


00:40:46.858 --> 00:40:50.275
I'm Michèle. Richard's ex.


00:40:51.858 --> 00:40:54.108
- Nice to meet you.
- Hello.


00:40:54.192 --> 00:40:56.650
Hope you don't mind me barging in.


00:40:56.733 --> 00:40:59.733
I wanted to apologize face to face.


00:40:59.983 --> 00:41:00.900
For what?


00:41:00.983 --> 00:41:03.192
Your car window. I'm sorry.


00:41:03.317 --> 00:41:07.733
Please. it's nothing. Anyway, Richard explained it all.


00:41:08.483 --> 00:41:10.733
Really? What was his explanation?


00:41:10.817 --> 00:41:12.942
It was an accident.


00:41:14.025 --> 00:41:16.692
Yes, that's right. An accident.


00:41:17.483 --> 00:41:19.650
And a good chance to meet you.


00:41:19.733 --> 00:41:20.900
Yes, great!


00:41:20.942 --> 00:41:23.358
It's wonderful finally meeting you.


00:41:23.525 --> 00:41:26.608
- I was thinking...
- Richard won't have to introduce us.


00:41:26.692 --> 00:41:28.775
We've dodged an awkward situation.


00:41:29.567 --> 00:41:31.817
Why would it be awkward?


00:41:32.650 --> 00:41:34.108
Well...


00:41:34.192 --> 00:41:36.150
Of course, you're right, it's...


00:41:36.483 --> 00:41:38.400
I guess we could have...


00:41:38.483 --> 00:41:41.275
- I mean...
- But it's behind us now.


00:41:41.400 --> 00:41:42.317
Exactly!


00:41:45.108 --> 00:41:48.233
We should get together some time, all of us.


00:41:48.900 --> 00:41:50.733
Yes. I'm having a Christmas party.


00:41:50.817 --> 00:41:53.108
You really must come.


00:41:53.442 --> 00:41:54.817
Come along.


00:41:55.358 --> 00:41:56.525
If I must.


00:41:56.692 --> 00:41:59.942
I'll give Richard the details.
I should get going.


00:42:00.567 --> 00:42:01.900
Lovely to meet you.


00:42:01.983 --> 00:42:04.025
Yes, lovely to have met you.


00:42:04.108 --> 00:42:05.483
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.


00:42:17.567 --> 00:42:18.275
Hello?


00:42:22.442 --> 00:42:24.067
Port Royal, right now?


00:42:25.817 --> 00:42:26.942
Really?


00:42:30.483 --> 00:42:32.817
She was losing blood. They did an ultrasound.


00:42:32.900 --> 00:42:35.358
- She has a...
- A placental abruption.


00:42:35.442 --> 00:42:37.858
They say it's okay but they're inducing labor.


00:42:37.942 --> 00:42:39.692
- Oh.
- Omar, a buddy of mine.


00:42:39.775 --> 00:42:40.983
- Hello.
- Dad!


00:42:41.067 --> 00:42:43.733
- What's the news?
- Nothing yet.


00:42:45.067 --> 00:42:47.150
- Hi.
- Hi.


00:42:47.233 --> 00:42:48.567
I'm right here.


00:42:48.650 --> 00:42:51.567
- I'm scared.
- It's gonna be okay.


00:42:53.067 --> 00:42:54.775
It hurts!


00:42:55.692 --> 00:42:57.358
I'll go get a coffee.


00:42:57.400 --> 00:42:58.858
Deep breaths.


00:42:58.942 --> 00:43:01.317
Fuck, it hurts!


00:43:01.942 --> 00:43:04.567
So suddenly you're throwing a Christmas party?


00:43:04.817 --> 00:43:08.400
I thought it'd be good to get to know each other better.


00:43:08.483 --> 00:43:09.817
She's lovely, by the way.


00:43:09.900 --> 00:43:11.108
Another of your traps?


00:43:11.192 --> 00:43:15.358
I have better things to do than
plot diabolical Christmas dinners.


00:43:16.483 --> 00:43:18.983
Is there anything she won't eat?
Any allergies?


00:43:19.108 --> 00:43:21.483
The cat's shedding like crazy.


00:43:23.192 --> 00:43:25.067
I made no fuss about your violinist.


00:43:25.150 --> 00:43:26.483
That was different!


00:43:26.567 --> 00:43:29.817
He was married with 3 kids. He checked every box.


00:43:30.233 --> 00:43:32.817
She's a young, single woman of child-bearing age.


00:43:32.900 --> 00:43:34.108
You've broken all the rules.


00:43:34.192 --> 00:43:37.483
First I heard we had an agreement.
It's not my fault if...


00:43:38.567 --> 00:43:41.733
It is your fault. We should still be together.


00:43:42.608 --> 00:43:44.817
- It's your fault.
- You left me.


00:43:44.900 --> 00:43:46.233
You hit me.


00:43:48.983 --> 00:43:52.150
If there's one thing in my life I regret, it's that.


00:43:53.733 --> 00:43:54.650
All done!


00:43:55.067 --> 00:43:56.525
- All done?
- Yes.


00:44:14.483 --> 00:44:17.150
We're going to need a DNA test.


00:44:28.483 --> 00:44:31.108
- Are they bringing him in?
- Right now.


00:44:31.567 --> 00:44:33.358
I'll be a good mother to him.


00:44:33.608 --> 00:44:35.400
Silly! You'll be awesome!


00:44:53.567 --> 00:44:54.733
Should we go?


00:44:56.233 --> 00:44:57.317
No.


00:44:57.483 --> 00:44:58.858
It's fine.


00:44:59.233 --> 00:45:00.733
Lots of people here.


00:45:09.942 --> 00:45:11.442
Hey, everybody!


00:45:15.858 --> 00:45:17.650
Who's a proud Daddy!


00:45:23.025 --> 00:45:26.108
A little marvel! Isn't he handsome!


00:45:26.192 --> 00:45:28.150
Look at that!


00:45:31.150 --> 00:45:33.150
This is where I had my son.


00:45:33.775 --> 00:45:35.192
In this maternity unit.


00:45:35.358 --> 00:45:36.608
That's funny.


00:45:37.108 --> 00:45:38.858
Not really. The amazing thing is,


00:45:38.942 --> 00:45:39.983
my friend Anna...


00:45:40.067 --> 00:45:43.067
- You saw her up there, you met her.
- Yes.


00:45:43.775 --> 00:45:46.358
She gave birth here that same night.


00:45:47.733 --> 00:45:49.733
This is where we met.


00:45:50.483 --> 00:45:53.442
Her child was still born. She asked to breastfeed mine.


00:45:54.150 --> 00:45:55.067
Oh my!


00:45:56.108 --> 00:45:58.400
I said to her, fine.


00:45:59.025 --> 00:46:01.525
Since then, I've often wondered.


00:46:02.442 --> 00:46:04.358
They've always been very close.


00:46:04.983 --> 00:46:06.442
Anna and my son.


00:46:07.358 --> 00:46:09.942
I wonder if there wasn't some kind of


00:46:11.192 --> 00:46:13.567
imprinting, like with ducks.


00:46:16.192 --> 00:46:18.067
With me. on the other hand...


00:46:18.358 --> 00:46:20.692
- You know...
- Sorry, they're paging me.


00:46:22.400 --> 00:46:23.983
Sometimes I look at Vincent,


00:46:24.442 --> 00:46:27.775
the big lout with nothing special about him


00:46:28.275 --> 00:46:29.900
that came out of my belly,


00:46:30.983 --> 00:46:32.983
and I have to admit I don't know him.


00:46:52.858 --> 00:46:54.817
- Evening, Michèle.
- Evening, Rebecca.


00:46:54.900 --> 00:46:57.567
Patrick will walk you inside. There's a prowler.


00:46:57.650 --> 00:47:00.400
- There is?
- Patrick fought with him.


00:47:00.483 --> 00:47:02.275
- A prowler?
- Yes.


00:47:02.317 --> 00:47:05.025
They're sending 3 cars after the creep.


00:47:05.400 --> 00:47:06.942
You fought with him?


00:47:07.025 --> 00:47:08.650
I caught him crouched in the bushes,


00:47:08.733 --> 00:47:10.483
watching your house.


00:47:10.567 --> 00:47:12.525
When I approached, he took off.


00:47:13.567 --> 00:47:14.983
You saw his face?


00:47:15.150 --> 00:47:17.942
No, he was wearing a mask, like a ski mask.


00:47:18.025 --> 00:47:20.025
Like a stalker on a TV show.


00:47:20.525 --> 00:47:21.525
He got away.


00:47:21.608 --> 00:47:23.608
Pat, go in with her.


00:47:23.692 --> 00:47:25.400
No, don't bother.


00:47:28.400 --> 00:47:31.067
- Do it anyway.
- Okay, be right back.


00:47:37.192 --> 00:47:39.317
It's really not necessary, honestly.


00:47:39.900 --> 00:47:41.983
I have pepper spray in the house.


00:47:42.400 --> 00:47:43.442
Good to know.


00:48:01.483 --> 00:48:03.817
Light switch on your left there.


00:48:15.608 --> 00:48:17.150
Everything seems to be okay.


00:48:17.400 --> 00:48:20.067
Thanks, anyway. I appreciate it.


00:48:20.275 --> 00:48:22.067
No problem, I didn't do much.


00:48:23.067 --> 00:48:24.067
I nearly caught him,


00:48:24.150 --> 00:48:25.733
but he took off so fast.


00:48:27.442 --> 00:48:30.192
In high school, I ran the 1,000 meters in 2.42.


00:48:32.775 --> 00:48:35.692
Perhaps his speed shows how scared he was of you.


00:48:37.817 --> 00:48:40.275
Thank you for salvaging my pride.


00:48:40.608 --> 00:48:41.775
You're welcome.


00:48:49.025 --> 00:48:50.108
Well...


00:48:59.233 --> 00:49:01.400
See anything or hear anything, just shout.


00:49:01.483 --> 00:49:02.567
Okay.


00:49:06.233 --> 00:49:07.733
I'm a grandmother.


00:49:09.483 --> 00:49:11.608
-Congratulations. -Thank you.


00:49:23.150 --> 00:49:25.108
God knows why I said that.


00:49:51.692 --> 00:49:53.025
Morning, Michèle.


00:49:55.817 --> 00:49:57.317
I like your sweater.


00:49:58.650 --> 00:49:59.650
Do you ski?


00:50:01.400 --> 00:50:02.275
Sure.


00:50:03.317 --> 00:50:04.525
I'll take you anytime.


00:50:27.983 --> 00:50:29.067
Kevin?


00:50:29.817 --> 00:50:31.567
You shoot, right?


00:50:32.483 --> 00:50:34.442
I mean. real shooting.


00:50:34.775 --> 00:50:36.192
That's right, I do.


00:50:37.025 --> 00:50:38.692
You own guns?


00:50:39.775 --> 00:50:41.192
A couple.


00:50:44.483 --> 00:50:46.025
Could you teach me?


00:50:46.692 --> 00:50:48.025
I could show you, sure.


00:50:54.317 --> 00:50:56.150
In real life, that'd do the job.


00:50:56.483 --> 00:50:58.900
In real life, he'd run faster.


00:50:59.400 --> 00:51:00.442
True.


00:51:01.192 --> 00:51:02.650
Try the .44 now.


00:51:10.400 --> 00:51:12.525
Kevin, I also wanted to talk to you


00:51:12.608 --> 00:51:15.733
because I've got an unofficial assignment for you.


00:51:15.983 --> 00:51:17.650
A black op?


00:51:18.983 --> 00:51:22.233
I want to know who created that animation.


00:51:23.692 --> 00:51:25.025
You know the one I mean?


00:51:26.858 --> 00:51:30.400
Hack into the home computers of the whole office.


00:51:31.025 --> 00:51:32.900
All the guys, at least.


00:51:34.317 --> 00:51:38.067
I want to help, but that's a major violation.


00:51:38.150 --> 00:51:40.942
I'm offering $10,000 cash in hand.


00:51:42.192 --> 00:51:44.692
Between you and me. Our secret.


00:51:47.608 --> 00:51:51.233
When you snoop on people, you turn up some weird shit.


00:51:51.317 --> 00:51:54.025
I know. I won't judge.


00:51:56.483 --> 00:51:57.858
Where does this one go?


00:51:58.192 --> 00:51:59.817
Put it right there.


00:53:57.483 --> 00:53:59.358
I untangled that one. Try it.


00:53:59.567 --> 00:54:02.608
- This one?
- On the right. I'll do the other next.


00:54:03.108 --> 00:54:05.108
-Hi, Rebecca! -Hi. Michèle.


00:54:05.192 --> 00:54:07.233
Beautiful!


00:54:07.650 --> 00:54:09.317
- Evening.
- Evening.


00:54:10.025 --> 00:54:13.525
The Nativity gets me every time. Where it all began.


00:54:14.483 --> 00:54:16.775
Very true.


00:54:18.775 --> 00:54:21.858
I know it's rude to invite you last minute,


00:54:21.942 --> 00:54:25.150
but I'm having a Christmas get-together tomorrow.


00:54:25.400 --> 00:54:26.983
Patrick, did you hear that?


00:54:27.067 --> 00:54:28.025
Yeah.


00:54:29.775 --> 00:54:30.900
With pleasure.


00:54:30.983 --> 00:54:32.275
Yes, with pleasure, absolutely.


00:54:32.358 --> 00:54:35.358
Well then...


00:54:35.900 --> 00:54:36.942
See you tomorrow.


00:54:37.025 --> 00:54:38.358
- See you then.
- See you then.


00:54:38.400 --> 00:54:39.400
Thank you.


00:54:46.692 --> 00:54:48.608
In theory, we could put a toothpick


00:54:48.692 --> 00:54:50.442
inside one for Richard's ladylove.


00:54:51.317 --> 00:54:53.025
Or just poison her.


00:54:53.108 --> 00:54:55.608
She has me pegged as a Medea, She'd see it coming.


00:54:55.692 --> 00:54:57.067
Consumed by jealousy.


00:54:57.483 --> 00:54:59.358
She was a classics major, too?


00:55:04.150 --> 00:55:06.317
-Josie. -Robert.


00:55:06.775 --> 00:55:07.692
Merry Christmas!


00:55:07.775 --> 00:55:09.108
- Okay, Dad?
- Great.


00:55:09.192 --> 00:55:10.233
Hi, kiddo.


00:55:10.317 --> 00:55:12.733
Jeez, he stinks. Here!


00:55:14.358 --> 00:55:15.692
How you doing?


00:55:16.775 --> 00:55:20.150
You trying to deafen us all with your shit? Careful.


00:55:20.233 --> 00:55:21.567
Hello, all!


00:55:22.275 --> 00:55:24.108
Merry Christmas!


00:55:28.483 --> 00:55:31.525
If I ever show up like that, kill me.


00:55:31.650 --> 00:55:32.983
Evening!


00:55:35.358 --> 00:55:36.692
- Evening!
- Evening!


00:55:36.858 --> 00:55:39.358
Sorry we're late. I was digging out a great...


00:55:39.442 --> 00:55:40.400
Excuse me.


00:55:40.983 --> 00:55:42.108
Cabernet.


00:55:44.442 --> 00:55:46.192
- Evening!
- Evening!


00:55:46.442 --> 00:55:47.900
Scrabble party!


00:55:49.733 --> 00:55:51.067
Thank you.


00:55:51.150 --> 00:55:52.150
- Evening!
- Evening!


00:55:52.275 --> 00:55:53.650
Any more alerts?


00:55:53.733 --> 00:55:55.900
No, the bogeyman's deserted us.


00:55:55.983 --> 00:55:58.942
Anyway, we're safe tonight.


00:55:59.025 --> 00:56:01.608
I got my red belt in March.


00:56:02.317 --> 00:56:05.858
I did Taekwondo for years before switching to Shotokan.


00:56:05.942 --> 00:56:07.442
I've never done karate.


00:56:07.650 --> 00:56:09.400
She was making fun of me.


00:56:10.150 --> 00:56:11.067
Ok.


00:56:15.358 --> 00:56:17.525
You can't avoid me all night.


00:56:17.650 --> 00:56:18.608
Want a bet?


00:56:26.275 --> 00:56:27.483
I'm glad you made it.


00:56:27.567 --> 00:56:29.275
We don't get out much.


00:56:29.358 --> 00:56:32.400
Unfortunately for Rebecca, who's a very social person.


00:56:33.108 --> 00:56:34.442
Unlike me.


00:56:35.025 --> 00:56:37.650
I'm glad she dragged you over here tonight.


00:56:39.650 --> 00:56:41.275
It was no hardship.


00:56:42.608 --> 00:56:43.775
Good evening!


00:56:44.317 --> 00:56:46.067
So sorry I'm late.


00:56:46.150 --> 00:56:47.858
I couldn't get off work.


00:56:47.942 --> 00:56:50.108
We just sat down. Hi, Hélène.


00:56:50.192 --> 00:56:51.400
- Evening!
- Evening!


00:56:51.483 --> 00:56:53.067
Evening, everybody.


00:56:53.150 --> 00:56:54.358
Irène, this is Hélène.


00:56:54.442 --> 00:56:55.858
- Evening!
- Evening!


00:56:55.942 --> 00:56:57.775
- Evening. I'm Ralf.
- Evening.


00:56:59.358 --> 00:57:01.108
Well, enjoy your meal!


00:57:01.358 --> 00:57:02.233
Thanks.


00:57:03.150 --> 00:57:04.608
I'm sorry...


00:57:04.817 --> 00:57:08.192
I'd like to say grace, if nobody objects.


00:57:10.025 --> 00:57:11.650
Of course not. Please do.


00:57:11.775 --> 00:57:13.192
Thank you.


00:57:16.108 --> 00:57:18.733
Bless us, Lord, and bless this meal.


00:57:19.317 --> 00:57:21.025
And provide bread to the needy.


00:57:21.775 --> 00:57:22.775
Amen.


00:57:22.858 --> 00:57:24.817
- Amen.
- Amen.


00:57:25.108 --> 00:57:26.275
Wine, Michèle?


00:57:26.358 --> 00:57:27.817
With pleasure.


00:57:28.358 --> 00:57:29.983
So, Patrick, what do you do?


00:57:30.192 --> 00:57:31.483
I work in banking.


00:57:32.400 --> 00:57:35.192
I'm a broker. And I plead guilty.


00:57:35.692 --> 00:57:36.733
How come?


00:57:37.233 --> 00:57:41.192
Just joking. It's not a popular profession right now.


00:57:41.358 --> 00:57:42.733
It never was.


00:57:44.067 --> 00:57:45.900
- I guess not.
- Well.


00:57:46.400 --> 00:57:47.567
To Christmas!


00:57:47.900 --> 00:57:48.942
And to us!


00:57:49.025 --> 00:57:53.275
Especially the newcomers to our table...


00:57:53.483 --> 00:57:54.608
Irène,


00:57:55.692 --> 00:57:56.858
Patrick,


00:57:57.108 --> 00:57:58.442
Rebecca.


00:58:02.150 --> 00:58:03.067
Ralf.


00:58:03.900 --> 00:58:04.775
Ralf.


00:58:05.358 --> 00:58:06.400
Merry Christmas!


00:58:06.733 --> 00:58:08.483
Merry Christmas!


00:58:10.400 --> 00:58:13.400
Michèle's worked like a trooper.


00:58:13.483 --> 00:58:14.442
Absolutely.


00:58:15.067 --> 00:58:16.608
I love cooking.


00:58:17.067 --> 00:58:18.025
When are you going?


00:58:18.108 --> 00:58:21.275
I'll try to book the...


00:58:23.067 --> 00:58:25.858
But the period we want books up fast.


00:58:26.400 --> 00:58:29.567
People don't realize the art muscle needs training.


00:58:29.650 --> 00:58:32.317
Or else culture collapses, goes flabby.


00:58:32.400 --> 00:58:35.192
That's what we've got now. Flabby culture.


00:58:35.442 --> 00:58:37.025
Is that aimed at me?


00:58:37.108 --> 00:58:38.650
Originality or singularity


00:58:38.733 --> 00:58:41.858
used to be valued and sought after.


00:58:42.067 --> 00:58:45.192
Or even an end in itself.
Now it's a liability.


00:58:45.275 --> 00:58:46.858
Richard's a theorist.


00:58:46.983 --> 00:58:49.108
I'm not talking about novelty.


00:58:49.192 --> 00:58:51.567
Coming out of our ass, novelty!


00:58:51.650 --> 00:58:53.358
Delightful image at dinner.


00:58:53.442 --> 00:58:56.442
Anyway, what's inspiration? 80% hard work.


00:58:56.525 --> 00:58:59.400
Some people know nothing of hard work.


00:58:59.483 --> 00:59:00.608
It's not in their culture.


00:59:00.692 --> 00:59:02.775
We know who you mean.


00:59:03.692 --> 00:59:05.150
I didn't say a word.


00:59:05.275 --> 00:59:07.567
Everybody's different. I love everyone.


00:59:11.650 --> 00:59:13.108
We're all children of God!


00:59:13.192 --> 00:59:16.858
Yeah, Africans eat goat's innards.
They're different.


00:59:16.942 --> 00:59:17.858
Exactly.


00:59:17.900 --> 00:59:20.275
I went on safari in Kenya. It was great.


00:59:20.358 --> 00:59:21.858
Right, there you go.


00:59:21.900 --> 00:59:23.442
I think now is a good time.


00:59:24.733 --> 00:59:26.442
I have an announcement to make.


00:59:28.567 --> 00:59:31.733
Ralf and I are engaged to be married.


00:59:42.317 --> 00:59:43.275
Sorry.


00:59:46.150 --> 00:59:48.358
How do you manage to be so grotesque?


00:59:49.983 --> 00:59:51.317
Don't you realize?


00:59:53.525 --> 00:59:55.608
I hope everyone likes blueberries.


00:59:57.067 --> 00:59:59.942
Josie added a ton to the official recipe.


01:00:00.025 --> 01:00:04.150
I was feeling creative, so I added blueberries.


01:00:06.817 --> 01:00:08.275
Looks good to me.


01:00:12.275 --> 01:00:15.608
It's almost midnight. Do you mind if I put on the Mass?


01:00:15.692 --> 01:00:16.942
On the contrary.


01:00:23.525 --> 01:00:24.650
You're leaving?


01:00:25.650 --> 01:00:27.192
It was wonderful. Really.


01:00:27.692 --> 01:00:29.692
Next time, our turn. You'll come to us.


01:00:29.775 --> 01:00:31.650
Let's not rush things.


01:00:31.733 --> 01:00:32.692
Leave it to us.


01:00:32.775 --> 01:00:36.692
We'll have lunch first, Michèle and I.


01:00:36.942 --> 01:00:37.942
Just the two of us.


01:00:38.358 --> 01:00:40.192
One step at a time.


01:00:40.317 --> 01:00:41.983
I agree, excellent idea.


01:00:42.317 --> 01:00:43.108
Goodnight.


01:00:43.192 --> 01:00:44.150
Great.


01:00:44.942 --> 01:00:46.275
- See you!
- See you!


01:00:48.483 --> 01:00:49.983
See you, 'night!


01:00:52.817 --> 01:00:55.275
Flirting with the banker, was that a test?


01:00:55.400 --> 01:00:58.775
You're making a scene in my home? It's come to that?


01:01:01.150 --> 01:01:03.650
- We'll talk later.
- Make yourself useful.


01:01:16.817 --> 01:01:17.900
Disaster!


01:01:17.942 --> 01:01:20.483
-That's two double words. -One double word.


01:01:20.567 --> 01:01:22.150
I can top that.


01:01:22.233 --> 01:01:23.775
Journey!


01:01:24.275 --> 01:01:26.150
- 64.
- Hold on, I've got it.


01:01:26.233 --> 01:01:27.400
No, that's 70.


01:01:27.442 --> 01:01:29.108
70, you see.


01:01:29.192 --> 01:01:30.400
My bad.


01:01:30.650 --> 01:01:32.400
- Ladies...
- No, thanks.


01:01:32.442 --> 01:01:34.108
- Sure?
- Really.


01:01:39.025 --> 01:01:41.108
Curse him! Damn him!


01:01:41.192 --> 01:01:44.650
Close the book, ring the bell, blow out the candle.


01:01:45.817 --> 01:01:46.858
What's that?


01:01:47.525 --> 01:01:48.608
Call yourself a Catholic?


01:01:48.692 --> 01:01:50.942
You don't know the excommunication rite?


01:01:51.983 --> 01:01:52.983
And you do?


01:01:54.483 --> 01:01:56.192
I've heard about it.


01:01:57.400 --> 01:01:59.608
My father made the sign of the cross on me,


01:02:00.150 --> 01:02:01.317
before I left for school.


01:02:01.567 --> 01:02:03.608
He did it to all the local kids


01:02:04.067 --> 01:02:06.442
until some parents asked him to stop.


01:02:06.525 --> 01:02:07.858
Sounds reasonable.


01:02:08.567 --> 01:02:10.942
Apparently, my father was offended.


01:02:11.650 --> 01:02:13.358
That night. he made the rounds.


01:02:14.567 --> 01:02:16.192
Knocked on every door,


01:02:16.608 --> 01:02:18.733
went into every house on the street


01:02:18.942 --> 01:02:20.400
with a shotgun, a butcher's mallet


01:02:20.483 --> 01:02:22.358
and a pair of kitchen knives.


01:02:23.275 --> 01:02:25.317
Yes, I heard about that.


01:02:25.608 --> 01:02:30.525
You heard about the 27 human victims, not about the animals.


01:02:30.900 --> 01:02:32.692
They never get a mention.


01:02:33.442 --> 01:02:34.483
6 dogs,


01:02:35.525 --> 01:02:37.108
a couple of cats, too.


01:02:38.192 --> 01:02:40.650
For whatever reason, he spared a hamster.


01:02:41.317 --> 01:02:42.817
You couldn't make it up.


01:02:48.692 --> 01:02:51.733
I was doing my homework when he arrived home


01:02:51.900 --> 01:02:53.442
with blood all over him.


01:02:54.358 --> 01:02:55.900
My mother was at work.


01:02:56.025 --> 01:02:58.275
She was a nurse back then.


01:02:58.567 --> 01:03:01.608
Can you imagine my mother. a nurse?


01:03:01.942 --> 01:03:03.483
Funny, isn't it?


01:03:03.692 --> 01:03:05.275
We don't have to go over it.


01:03:05.483 --> 01:03:08.567
I don't mind. It does me good to talk.


01:03:10.442 --> 01:03:12.692
He decided to burn everything in the house.


01:03:13.775 --> 01:03:15.192
I helped feed the fire.


01:03:15.275 --> 01:03:17.900
We gutted the place. Curtains, carpets...


01:03:17.983 --> 01:03:19.358
Tables, chairs...


01:03:19.650 --> 01:03:20.692
All in the fire.


01:03:21.317 --> 01:03:24.525
It was exciting. You get caught up in it.


