02:01:46.817 --> 02:01:49.442
What's it for if not to get through tough times?


02:01:50.442 --> 02:01:54.483
Patrick was a good man but he had a tortured soul.


02:02:01.442 --> 02:02:03.358
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.


02:02:06.192 --> 02:02:07.192
Michèle!


02:02:08.858 --> 02:02:11.983
I'm sincerely glad you could give him what he needed.


02:02:12.067 --> 02:02:13.483
For a time, at least.


02:02:31.983 --> 02:02:33.192
Hey there!


02:02:33.942 --> 02:02:35.400
Wow, beautiful!


02:02:35.483 --> 02:02:36.358
Check it out.


02:02:36.650 --> 02:02:38.150
Josie let me choose.


02:02:39.817 --> 02:02:40.942
A convertible.


02:02:41.025 --> 02:02:42.317
He's earned it.


02:02:42.400 --> 02:02:43.567
Hello.


02:02:47.317 --> 02:02:48.650
Let's go.


02:02:51.025 --> 02:02:52.317
Baby!


02:02:57.900 --> 02:02:58.858
Happy?


02:03:00.192 --> 02:03:01.400
Crazy!


02:03:28.817 --> 02:03:30.275
I heard you were here.


02:03:35.233 --> 02:03:36.692
Physically, anyway.


02:03:48.483 --> 02:03:50.692
We're going ahead with Richard's project?


02:03:50.775 --> 02:03:53.025
Let him fool around for a while.


02:03:55.400 --> 02:03:56.983
How's Robert?


02:03:59.608 --> 02:04:01.983
- I kicked him out.
- No.


02:04:02.525 --> 02:04:04.692
Ever since, he's hit the bottle.


02:04:05.692 --> 02:04:07.358
What did you see in him?


02:04:07.983 --> 02:04:09.775
It was just one of those things.


02:04:10.233 --> 02:04:11.400
An opportunity.


02:04:12.483 --> 02:04:13.817
I wanted to get laid.


02:04:16.775 --> 02:04:19.900
That's no excuse. It was shabby.


02:04:21.400 --> 02:04:22.983
Worse than that even.


02:04:33.650 --> 02:04:35.358
Vincent's grown up now.


02:04:36.442 --> 02:04:37.858
It's just the two of us.


02:04:39.358 --> 02:04:41.608
And I'm all alone in that huge house.


02:04:42.692 --> 02:04:43.983
I'm going to sell it.


02:04:45.317 --> 02:04:49.317
I was thinking I could move in with you for a while.

